This directory will contain DXF template files with pre-configured layers
for landscape design plans. Templates include:

- residential_landscape.dxf — Standard residential plan (layers, title block)
- commercial_landscape.dxf — Commercial plan template
- planting_plan.dxf — Planting plan with plant schedule table
- irrigation_plan.dxf — Irrigation layout template

These will be generated programmatically with the correct layer setup.
